# OS-package advisories the image scan (.github/workflows/audit.yml,
# scripts/ci/trivy-image.sh) skips: one CVE id per line, with a comment
# saying why it has to wait and which image. Prefer bumping the base image;
# drop an entry once its fix lands.

# pgvector/pgvector:0.8.7-pg16 (bookworm), the Postgres image in
