# Same image (Epo 2026-10-29, Q574): libssl3/openssl CVE-2026-84782 is a DTLS
# handshake retransmission over-read; Postgres speaks TLS over TCP only and is
# reachable only on the WireGuard link. Pin pgvector's next clean rebuild.
